{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596980/extras/9b33dd1138ebeea1c4d943d807c71d8f.poster.avif?t=1750001756\" width=412 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596980/extras/9b33dd1138ebeea1c4d943d807c71d8f.webm?t=1750001756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596980/extras/9b33dd1138ebeea1c4d943d807c71d8f.mp4?t=1750001756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to reach the exit in each level. The game doesn\u2019t require quick reflexes or fast actions but rather logical thinking and an understanding of the interactions between game objects and the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Twist of Light</i></strong>, every puzzle introduces a fresh idea or expands on a familiar one. The levels feature various blocks. They have peculiar properties that complement each other \u2014 their behavior is gradually revealed through gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3596980?t=1750001756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3596980?t=1750001756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596980/3fa9531c837b5f83ccaf52fd0f6889b5d4b86d6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750001756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596980/3fa9531c837b5f83ccaf52fd0f6889b5d4b86d6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750001756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descripto